diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index ff92be649ff3f610b38798b3310751534d032814..d6a8ee9101649ae36c156b93618613d6a58610d0 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,22 @@
 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+## API
+
+### `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`
+
+Resolves a [JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901) (RFC 6901) against a JSON document
+and returns the value it refers to.
+
+```ts
+import { resolvePointer } from 'json-toolkit';
+
+const document = { foo: ['bar', 'baz'] };
+
+resolvePointer(document, '/foo/0'); // => "bar"
+resolvePointer(document, '');       // => the whole document
+```
+
+Throws a `JsonPointerError` when `pointer` is not a valid JSON Pointer, or when it does not resolve to
+a value within `document`.
diff --git a/docs/memory/decision-log/dl-001-json-pointer-dedicated-error-type-and-strict-rfc-6901-validation.md b/docs/memory/decision-log/dl-001-json-pointer-dedicated-error-type-and-strict-rfc-6901-validation.md
